  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mi>I</mi></munder><munder><munder><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math>putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
